Conclusion--
-- Today I learned that scene understanding and spatial mapping allow XR devices to understand not only where the user is located but also what objects exist 
in the surrounding environment. By recognizing surfaces such as walls, floors, and tables, virtual objects can be placed more naturally and remain stable as the user moves. 
These technologies make mixed reality experiences more realistic, interactive, and useful for everyday applications.
